        "25^(x+4) = 125^(3x) becomes 5^(2(x+4)) = 5^(3×3x), i.e. 5^(2x+8) = 5^(9x)",
        "Since the bases match, the powers must be equal: 2x + 8 = 9x",
        "Rearranging: -7x = -8, so x = -8/-7 = 8/7"
